/extras/ec526237b05cb198d073b16be1d14f0e.webm?t=1787800420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/ec526237b05cb198d073b16be1d14f0e.mp4?t=1787800420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s more to life than just your witch studies! Spend your free time (and your hard-earned witch-business profits) however you please. Shop ‘til you drop at Mossport’s boutiques and eateries, and sell your crafts at the Sunday market. Or spend your weekend chasing a new highscore at the arcade, documenting Mossport through your camera lens, or picking out the perfect gift for a romantic date. Mossport is full of ways to unwind and express yourself!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/a872ce3513c30c7ff363f2a20b146559.webp?t=1787800420\" width=450 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/aa2fc04ce82bb33d045d183aa0fa46ea.poster.avif?t=1787800420\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/aa2fc04ce82bb33d045d183aa0fa46ea.webm?t=1787800420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/aa2fc04ce82bb33d045d183aa0fa46ea.mp4?t=1787800420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can experience this spellbinding adventure in online co-op. Whether you’re racing on brooms through the park, honing your spellcrafting know-how or just enjoying hanging out in idyllic Mossport, there’s always more fun to be had with friends!<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/111ef47e6c8eae30f34a11d797306fdc.apng?t=1787800420\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/111ef47e6c8eae30f34a11d797306fdc.poster.avif?t=1787800420\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=120 /></picture></span></p>", "short_description": "Discover magic and mystery in Witchbrook, a spellbinding witch life-sim for up to 4-players! Start your life as the newest resident witch in the bustling seaside town of Mossport. Make friends, find love, and discover a world filled with wonder and charm on the road to graduation and beyond...", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/51ffec115f4052d63621745305336a4b1ee14ad3/header.jpg?t=1787800420", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/86ceee35583b2f963db9246e87d9d93bef897811/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787800420", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/86ceee35583b2f963db9246e87d9d93bef897811/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787800420", "website": "https://witchbrook.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+, 64-bit only<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX11 compatible video card with at least 4 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "